{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">How would the world look after an asteroid impact or another catastrophic disaster?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Exactly as you imagine it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This set will help you bring to life a world on the brink of a second chance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you leave it in ruins, or will you rebuild it for a better future? The choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Asteroid impact sites and craters, destroyed cities or thriving settlements, wasteland farms and underground bunkers, forests and dried wastelands\u2026 and much more with your imagination!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Inside the Tileset folder, you'll find A1, A2, A4, A5, B, C, D, and E in multiple variations:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Color</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Day</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Night</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Night2</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">--Contents--</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Tilesets: 48 sheets</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <strong>Bonus:</strong> 1x <i>Windy Forest</i> audio track included in the sample project.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-----------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fbThis pack is for use in RPG Maker Series or the engine of your choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fbOK to be used in Commercial projects made in RPG Maker</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fbYou may modify some of the assets (but not redistribute them) for your own game use only.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3689470?t=1747271639","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/im